        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f957df5c090a6fdb3e85",
          "document_start": 369,
          "document_end": 394,
          "text": "# （一）包含弹丸运动的膛口流场仿真网格模型建立;",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 369,
          "end": 394,
          "chunk_start": 369,
          "chunk_end": 394,
          "sentence_document_start": 369,
          "sentence_document_end": 394,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_977f511f00ee0a935420",
          "document_start": 395,
          "document_end": 427,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 395,
          "end": 427,
          "chunk_start": 395,
          "chunk_end": 427,
          "sentence_document_start": 395,
          "sentence_document_end": 427,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a306b401df9035e198bd",
          "document_start": 429,
          "document_end": 492,
          "text": "数值计算采用的网格可分为结构化网格和非结构化网格，两维时分别是四边形网格单元和三角形网格单元，三维时分别是六面体和四面体单元。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 429,
          "end": 492,
          "chunk_start": 429,
          "chunk_end": 492,
          "sentence_document_start": 429,
          "sentence_document_end": 492,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_271c0461cb0df7719ae1",
          "document_start": 492,
          "document_end": 554,
          "text": "结构化网格一般是在正交与非正交曲线坐标系中生成的，每一节点与邻点之间的联结关系固定不变，其拓扑结构对复杂边界的描述比较困难。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 492,
          "end": 554,
          "chunk_start": 492,
          "chunk_end": 554,
          "sentence_document_start": 492,
          "sentence_document_end": 554,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_af63b1b444fb9fea68dc",
          "document_start": 554,
          "document_end": 603,
          "text": "而在非结构网格中，节点的编号没有规则，甚至是完全随意的，而且每一个节点的邻点个数也不是规定不变的。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 554,
          "end": 603,
          "chunk_start": 554,
          "chunk_end": 603,
          "sentence_document_start": 554,
          "sentence_document_end": 603,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b4d9ed641d96873c3a59",
          "document_start": 603,
          "document_end": 673,
          "text": "非结构网格的这种不规则，无固定结构的特点，使其具有十分灵活的适用性和对复杂边界较强的描述能力，而且可以方便地在计算流场中应用网格自适应方法。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 603,
          "end": 673,
          "chunk_start": 603,
          "chunk_end": 673,
          "sentence_document_start": 603,
          "sentence_document_end": 673,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_309b24bdf46f98056836",
          "document_start": 673,
          "document_end": 726,
          "text": "通常采用阵面推进法生成非结构网格，其生成节点和网格是同步进行的，可以根据不同的空间尺度来控制网格密度大小。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 673,
          "end": 726,
          "chunk_start": 673,
          "chunk_end": 726,
          "sentence_document_start": 673,
          "sentence_document_end": 726,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_fd84ff429a2282bef026",
          "document_start": 726,
          "document_end": 851,
          "text": "网格生成过程中，网格点的编号不必顺序进行，但输入几何位置的坐标时应按上述规定方向进行，一旦新的节点确定下来，它与阵面中的一条活动边就确定了一个新的网格，则该网格活动边就不再是阵面元素了，新网格中刚生成的两条边加入了阵面元素的行列，阵面推进法得以进行。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 726,
          "end": 851,
          "chunk_start": 726,
          "chunk_end": 851,
          "sentence_document_start": 726,
          "sentence_document_end": 851,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_2ae1f406f4e865ef9563",
          "document_start": 851,
          "document_end": 886,
          "text": "直到阵面上活动边数目减少到零，计算区域的非结构化网格划分过程才能结束。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 851,
          "end": 886,
          "chunk_start": 851,
          "chunk_end": 886,
          "sentence_document_start": 851,
          "sentence_document_end": 886,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_68604c33ab959f71a91a",
          "document_start": 886,
          "document_end": 910,
          "text": "该方法生成的网格质量较好，对边界的离散也很理想。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 886,
          "end": 910,
          "chunk_start": 886,
          "chunk_end": 910,
          "sentence_document_start": 886,
          "sentence_document_end": 910,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b14ac53f6a54294be51f",
          "document_start": 910,
          "document_end": 972,
          "text": "非结构网格的优越性使其成为近年来研究的热点，被广泛应用于求解Euler方程和N-S方程、大范围瞬态流动、高速黏性流动等方面。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 910,
          "end": 972,
          "chunk_start": 910,
          "chunk_end": 972,
          "sentence_document_start": 910,
          "sentence_document_end": 972,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_7a6ec23ad639cc7c49f5",
          "document_start": 974,
          "document_end": 994,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 974,
          "end": 994,
          "chunk_start": 974,
          "chunk_end": 994,
          "sentence_document_start": 974,
          "sentence_document_end": 994,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5e2075824e15197757df",
          "document_start": 995,
          "document_end": 1020,
          "text": "# 四、基于有限体积法流体力学方程离散及求解方法;",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 995,
          "end": 1020,
          "chunk_start": 995,
          "chunk_end": 1020,
          "sentence_document_start": 995,
          "sentence_document_end": 1020,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_7a65dbd8463c9d6b5b5d",
          "document_start": 1021,
          "document_end": 1053,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1021,
          "end": 1053,
          "chunk_start": 1021,
          "chunk_end": 1053,
          "sentence_document_start": 1021,
          "sentence_document_end": 1053,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ffa5545bbe5290cbe8d0",
          "document_start": 1055,
          "document_end": 1136,
          "text": "有限体积法（FVM），又称控制体法，是将计算区域划分为网格，并使每个网格点周围有一个互不重复的控制体积，将待解的微分方程对每个控制体积积分，从而得到一组离散方程。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1055,
          "end": 1136,
          "chunk_start": 1055,
          "chunk_end": 1136,
          "sentence_document_start": 1055,
          "sentence_document_end": 1136,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4e65bb45af12e1ac5e30",
          "document_start": 1136,
          "document_end": 1152,
          "text": "其中未知数是网格节点上的因变量。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1136,
          "end": 1152,
          "chunk_start": 1136,
          "chunk_end": 1152,
          "sentence_document_start": 1136,
          "sentence_document_end": 1152,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_01e55284f308a8cf65b9",
          "document_start": 1152,
          "document_end": 1172,
          "text": "子域法加离散，就是有限体积法的基本思路。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1152,
          "end": 1172,
          "chunk_start": 1152,
          "chunk_end": 1172,
          "sentence_document_start": 1152,
          "sentence_document_end": 1172,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e569e53e27b4777ab47a",
          "document_start": 1172,
          "document_end": 1232,
          "text": "离散方程的物理意义就是因变量在有限大小的控制体积中的守恒原理，如同微分方程表示因变量在无限小的控制体积中的守恒原理一样。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1172,
          "end": 1232,
          "chunk_start": 1172,
          "chunk_end": 1232,
          "sentence_document_start": 1172,
          "sentence_document_end": 1232,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_12a74d3732c73356189a",
          "document_start": 1232,
          "document_end": 1286,
          "text": "有限体积法得出的离散方程，要求因变量的积分守恒对任意一组控制体积都得到满足，对整个计算区域，自然也得到满足。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1232,
          "end": 1286,
          "chunk_start": 1232,
          "chunk_end": 1286,
          "sentence_document_start": 1232,
          "sentence_document_end": 1286,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_72cc28169ea42a072648",
          "document_start": 1286,
          "document_end": 1331,
          "text": "有限体积法适于流体计算，可以应用于不规则网格，即使在粗网格情况下，也显示出准确的积分守恒。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1286,
          "end": 1331,
          "chunk_start": 1286,
          "chunk_end": 1331,
          "sentence_document_start": 1286,
          "sentence_document_end": 1331,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9e023f4fd567fee6a315",
          "document_start": 1331,
          "document_end": 1381,
          "text": "有限体积法是将非线性偏微分方程转变为网格单元上的线性代数方程，然后通过求解线性方程组，得出流场的解。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1331,
          "end": 1381,
          "chunk_start": 1331,
          "chunk_end": 1381,
          "sentence_document_start": 1331,
          "sentence_document_end": 1381,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_02b1698a335da78e4b99",
          "document_start": 1381,
          "document_end": 1406,
          "text": "网格划分可以将连续的空间划分为相互连接的网格单元。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1381,
          "end": 1406,
          "chunk_start": 1381,
          "chunk_end": 1406,
          "sentence_document_start": 1381,
          "sentence_document_end": 1406,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0691427e7509070012dd",
          "document_start": 1406,
          "document_end": 1444,
          "text": "每个网格单元由位于几何中心的控制点和将网格单元包围起来的网格面（或线）构成。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1406,
          "end": 1444,
          "chunk_start": 1406,
          "chunk_end": 1444,
          "sentence_document_start": 1406,
          "sentence_document_end": 1444,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_7d6430c63902d8603fcd",
          "document_start": 1444,
          "document_end": 1477,
          "text": "所谓求解流场的控制方程，最终目的就是获得所有控制点上流场变量的值。",
          "section_id": "section_a21ef50e1574",
          "start": 1444,
          "end": 1477,
          "chunk_start": 1444,
          "chunk_end": 1477,
          "sentence_document_start": 1444,
          "sentence_document_end": 1477,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
      ],
